/* Numbers are rendered with Western digits (0-9) throughout, including inside
   Arabic text. That is what Algerian road signs, phone numbers, prices and
   official forms use, so it is what reads as native here; Arabic-Indic numerals
   would look archaic and slow the reader down in a tool meant to be scanned
   quickly. Direction stays RTL — this is a numeral choice, not a layout one. */
